
# militancy for movement infrastructure (canvass networks, online-right
# mobilization) - willingness to strike/disrupt or escalate beyond normal
# politics, not literal paramilitary violence. Same 0-1+ numeric scale as
# the original.

(..0.05) Nonexistent
(0.05..0.14) Very low
(0.14..0.24) Low
(0.24..0.44) Medium-low
(0.44..0.69) Medium
(0.69..1) High
(1..) Very high
